w=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\">万元。</font></span><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;\"=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 23pt; text-indent: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;\"=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\">服务期限</font></span><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;\"=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\">：</font></span><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;\"=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\">45</font></span><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;\"=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\">日历天。</font></span><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;\"=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 23pt; text-indent: 24.1pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-line-height-rule: exactly;\"><b><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;\"=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\">3.投标人资格要求</font></span></b><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;\"=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin: 0.1pt 0pt 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: 150%; text-indent: 25.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: char; -ms-word-break: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-pagination: none; punctuation-wrap: simple; punctuation-trim: leading;\"><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;=\"\" new=\"\" roman