mes=\"\" 1.0000pt;=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"宋体\">。</font></span><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin: 0.1pt 0pt 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: 150%; text-indent: 25.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: char; -ms-word-break: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-pagination: none; punctuation-wrap: simple; punctuation-trim: leading;\"><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">3.3 </font><font face=\"宋体\">拟派项目负责人具有水利行业相关专业高级及以上职称，且为本单位在职人员。</font></span><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin: 0.1pt 0pt 0pt; text-align: left; line-height: 150%; text-indent: 25.6pt; vertical-align: baseline; -ms-layout-grid-mode: char; -ms-word-break: break-all; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000; mso-layout-grid-align: none; mso-pagination: none; punctuation-wrap: simple; punctuation-trim: leading;\"><span \"times=\"\" 1.0000pt;=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" roman\";\"=\"\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12pt;\" yes\";=\"\"><font face=\"Times New Roman\">3.4</font><font face=\"宋体\">其他要求：</font></span><span \"yes\";=\"\" 1.0000pt;=\"\" 12pt;=\"\" new=\"\" roman\";=\"\" style=\"line-height: 150%; letter-spacing: 0.4pt; font-family:;\" times=\"\" 宋体;\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin: 0